  "provenance": "agent_prepack",
  "source_request": "보강한 8개 후보가 검색되지 않는 원인을 분석해서 검색·선택 과정을 추가로 개선해줘. 같은 사진으로 Luna max 독립 서브에이전트 3개에서 다시 생성하고 신규 데이터가 실제로 반영되는지 검증해줘. 이번엔 creativity=2로 테스트해줘.",
  "interpreted_intent": "The linked prior-user topic resolves the current reference to clothing and fashion. I want a photograph in which clothes carry a lived transition rather than sit like a catalog display. A fitting-room pause would make the change literal; a departing train makes the day’s ending visible and leaves a route forward, so I choose the station. The ink-blue coat, copper lining, and hand at the lapel are my staging choices and remain open to the creativity-2 reconstruction. The portrait guides visible face and hair cues only; its pixels do not establish identity, age, body, or personality. A small ease in the subject’s gaze supports the image’s sensual level as a quiet quality beneath the fashion direction.",
  "subject": "A human fashion subject guided by the supplied portrait’s visible face and hair.",
  "setting": "A city rail platform at dusk, between the day’s commute and an evening route.",
  "event": "A new fashion editorial photograph catches the subject pausing as the final train pulls away and the amber stairs open a route into evening.",
  "visual_priorities": [
    "The supplied portrait guides the visible face and dark hair.",
    "The coat, blouse, and copper lining carry the fashion direction.",
    "The departing train and lit stairs make the day-to-evening choice legible.",
    "A hand at the lapel keeps textile contact and subject presence together."
  ],
  "baseline_prompt_en": "A new fashion editorial photograph catches the human subject on a city rail platform at dusk, at the hinge between the last hour of work and an evening still waiting to begin. The supplied portrait guides the subject’s visible face and hair: a softly oval face, dark brown eyes, and a jaw-length dark brown bob with airy, separated fringe. The human subject stands in an easy, balanced pause just inside the platform light, three-quarter turned toward the amber stairwell. One of the subject’s hands settles at the lapel of an ink-blue, softly sculpted wool coat, fingertips pressing a clean fold above a pale satin blouse; the other arm hangs relaxed by the subject’s side. A narrow copper lining glows where the lapel turns, a small after-hours accent within the day’s precise silhouette. Behind the subject, the last train pulls away, its final red window slipping through a glass partition and leaving open platform in its wake. A route diagram fades into soft focus; the amber stairwell light leads toward the night street beyond. The departing train and the subject’s quiet turn make a simple choice visible: the workday has ended, and the next part of the evening is open. Frame this as a full-length vertical fashion portrait with both shoes planted on the platform and visible, keeping the face, lapel contact, and coat shape clear while the train recedes as a soft directional blur. Cool station light skims the wool and satin; a warm rim from the stairs finds the hair and copper lining, preserving natural skin color and tactile fabric. The expression is composed but softening, with restrained ease in the eyes and shoulders. The image should feel like a candid pause inside a considered fashion portrait—precise tailoring, a wisp of motion in the fringe, and the second before the subject leaves the platform.",
